cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset or the demo, please cite it as below.
title: "Terra: live CDC source datasets"
version: 0.1.0
# date-released is added by the person who cuts the v0.1.0 release (see CHANGELOG.md).
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/artie-labs/terra
url: https://artie.world
authors:
  - name: Artie Technologies, Inc.
    website: https://www.artie.com
keywords:
  - change data capture
  - logical replication
  - postgres
  - schema evolution
  - sample dataset
abstract: >-
  A synthetic safari database in Postgres 16 with logical replication, a
  continuous deterministic writer, eight numbered schema-evolution events, a
  Postgres subscriber as an offline replication consumer, and a verifier that
  compares source and destination after each event.
